{"id":"region-list","title":"Danger regions","category":"reference","icon":"minecraft:wither_rose","summary":"The six danger regions, their mobs, drops and bosses.","blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Danger regions are patches of the survival world that spawn tougher mobs and drop special loot. Each has a boss and a sigil. Danger runs from 1 (mild) to 5."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"The Mire","anchor":"the-mire"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"A poisoned swamp where the water is thick enough to walk on, almost. Hags brew in the reeds."}]},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Danger: 2, mob level bonus: +12"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Mobs: Bog Hag, Mire Witch, Slime, Mire Lurker"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Drops: "},{"x":"Mire Essence","item":"skyrpg_world:mire_essence","icon":"skyrpg_world:mire_essence","color":"#55FF55"},{"x":", "},{"x":"Dread Crystal","item":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","icon":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","color":"#AA00AA"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Boss: The Bog Mother"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Sigil: "},{"x":"Mire Heart Sigil","item":"skyrpg_world:mire_sigil","icon":"skyrpg_world:mire_sigil","color":"#AA00AA"}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"The Blightlands","anchor":"the-blightlands"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"A rot that spreads from something buried deep. The trees are dead, the ground is grey, and the dead walk in daylight."}]},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Danger: 3, mob level bonus: +15"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Mobs: Blighted Dead, Blight Archer, Gravecaller, Hollow Wisp, Blight Witch"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Drops: "},{"x":"Blight Essence","item":"skyrpg_world:blight_essence","icon":"skyrpg_world:blight_essence","color":"#55FF55"},{"x":", "},{"x":"Dread Crystal","item":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","icon":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","color":"#AA00AA"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Boss: The Blight Lord"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Sigil: "},{"x":"Blightlands Heart Sigil","item":"skyrpg_world:blightlands_sigil","icon":"skyrpg_world:blightlands_sigil","color":"#AA00AA"}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"The Haunted Moors","anchor":"the-haunted-moors"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Grey fog over dead grass, crooked headstones and open graves. The lights out on the moor are not lanterns."}]},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Danger: 3, mob level bonus: +16"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Mobs: Moor Ghost, Gravecaller, Hollow Wisp, Restless Dead"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Drops: "},{"x":"Ectoplasm","item":"skyrpg_world:ectoplasm","icon":"skyrpg_world:ectoplasm","color":"#55FF55"},{"x":", "},{"x":"Dread Crystal","item":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","icon":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","color":"#AA00AA"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Boss: The Lantern Wraith"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Sigil: "},{"x":"Haunted Moors Heart Sigil","item":"skyrpg_world:haunted_moors_sigil","icon":"skyrpg_world:haunted_moors_sigil","color":"#AA00AA"}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"The Ashen Wastes","anchor":"the-ashen-wastes"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Burnt flat by a fire that never quite went out. The ground smoulders and the things that walk here like it hot."}]},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Danger: 4, mob level bonus: +18"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Mobs: Ember Imp, Ash Walker, Cinder Wraith, Charred Revenant"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Drops: "},{"x":"Cinder Essence","item":"skyrpg_world:cinder_essence","icon":"skyrpg_world:cinder_essence","color":"#55FF55"},{"x":", "},{"x":"Dread Crystal","item":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","icon":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","color":"#AA00AA"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Boss: The Ash Colossus"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Sigil: "},{"x":"Ashen Wastes Heart Sigil","item":"skyrpg_world:ashen_wastes_sigil","icon":"skyrpg_world:ashen_wastes_sigil","color":"#AA00AA"}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Frostgrave","anchor":"frostgrave"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"A graveyard under the snow. The cold here is older than winter, and the frozen dead remember how to hunt."}]},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Danger: 4, mob level bonus: +18"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Mobs: Frost Revenant, Frostbound Archer, Frozen Dead"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Drops: "},{"x":"Frost Essence","item":"skyrpg_world:frost_essence","icon":"skyrpg_world:frost_essence","color":"#55FF55"},{"x":", "},{"x":"Dread Crystal","item":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","icon":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","color":"#AA00AA"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Boss: The Frost Revenant King"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Sigil: "},{"x":"Frostgrave Heart Sigil","item":"skyrpg_world:frostgrave_sigil","icon":"skyrpg_world:frostgrave_sigil","color":"#AA00AA"}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"The Shattered Highlands","anchor":"the-shattered-highlands"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The mountains split and drifted apart. Rock hangs in the sky, the wind has teeth, and something huge circles the high ledges."}]},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Danger: 4, mob level bonus: +20"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Mobs: Windborn, Cliff Stalker, Gale Harpy"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Drops: "},{"x":"Gale Essence","item":"skyrpg_world:gale_essence","icon":"skyrpg_world:gale_essence","color":"#55FF55"},{"x":", "},{"x":"Dread Crystal","item":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","icon":"skyrpg_world:dread_crystal","color":"#AA00AA"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Boss: The Storm Griffin"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Sigil: "},{"x":"Shattered Highlands Heart Sigil","item":"skyrpg_world:shattered_highlands_sigil","icon":"skyrpg_world:shattered_highlands_sigil","color":"#AA00AA"}]}]}]}